    "detailed_description": "<h1>Special Offer</h1><p></p><br><h1>Special Offer</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Elemental Land: A Casual and Cross-Platform MMORPG!</h2><br>Prepare to dive into a fantastic world filled with exciting adventures, magical creatures, and hidden treasures. &quot;Elemental Land&quot; is a casual MMORPG that unites PC and mobile players in a single immersive experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf1f Cross-Platform Gameplay:</h2>Play with your friends, whether they are on PC or mobile. The adventure never stops!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/001b50ff8f7aeed16c0dd1f2a8a7c9ef.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Open World:</h2>Explore vast territories with diverse biomes, from enchanted forests to mysterious deserts and snowy mountains. Every corner of the world holds unique secrets and challenges.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/a220e56e8cea569d1b08f53a1426d76a.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f Exciting Battles:</h2>Face epic monsters and challenging bosses with an intuitive combat system. Customize your skills and equipment to become the most powerful hero.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/73db723df531106386a4dac9135e7301.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Character Customization:</h2>Create your unique hero with various appearance options, classes, and skills. Evolve and discover new ways to play with each level you gain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/dfdcb13db192226bfa06e9e6685f28b5.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd1d Vibrant Community:</h2>Join guilds, participate in real-time events, and make new friends in a welcoming community. Collaborate on group missions and achieve glory together.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/c6bc6b051c79ef3b20a051bcde7941a7.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf89 Regular Events:</h2>Enjoy seasonal events, daily challenges, and exclusive rewards. There is always something new to discover in &quot;Elemental Land.&quot;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/c1e85f6a2d865601d1832850b3a5ac54.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca1 Easy Access:</h2>Designed for casual play, &quot;Elemental Land&quot; is perfect for both quick sessions and gaming marathons. Access your account from any device and continue your journey where you left off.<br><br>Join &quot;Elemental Land&quot; now and become part of an ever-evolving legend. Fantasy awaits you!<br><br><strong>The game will be free.</strong><br><br><strong>How will the game servers be maintained if it's free?</strong><br>Through the sale of cosmetics and mounts in the cash shop.<br><br><strong>Will there be any items that give players an advantage in the cash shop?</strong><br>No, there will be no items that give players an advantage. Only cosmetics and some services will be sold.<br><br><strong>Will the game be released on other platforms?</strong><br>Initially, the game will be released for PC and Android, then it will be made available on other platforms.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Welcome to Elemental Land: A Casual and Cross-Platform MMORPG!</h2><br>Prepare to dive into a fantastic world filled with exciting adventures, magical creatures, and hidden treasures. &quot;Elemental Land&quot; is a casual MMORPG that unites PC and mobile players in a single immersive experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf1f Cross-Platform Gameplay:</h2>Play with your friends, whether they are on PC or mobile. The adventure never stops!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/001b50ff8f7aeed16c0dd1f2a8a7c9ef.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Open World:</h2>Explore vast territories with diverse biomes, from enchanted forests to mysterious deserts and snowy mountains. Every corner of the world holds unique secrets and challenges.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/a220e56e8cea569d1b08f53a1426d76a.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2694\ufe0f Exciting Battles:</h2>Face epic monsters and challenging bosses with an intuitive combat system. Customize your skills and equipment to become the most powerful hero.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/73db723df531106386a4dac9135e7301.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Character Customization:</h2>Create your unique hero with various appearance options, classes, and skills. Evolve and discover new ways to play with each level you gain.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/dfdcb13db192226bfa06e9e6685f28b5.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udd1d Vibrant Community:</h2>Join guilds, participate in real-time events, and make new friends in a welcoming community. Collaborate on group missions and achieve glory together.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/c6bc6b051c79ef3b20a051bcde7941a7.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf89 Regular Events:</h2>Enjoy seasonal events, daily challenges, and exclusive rewards. There is always something new to discover in &quot;Elemental Land.&quot;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948400/extras/c1e85f6a2d865601d1832850b3a5ac54.avif?t=1717961268\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udca1 Easy Access:</h2>Designed for casual play, &quot;Elemental Land&quot; is perfect for both quick sessions and gaming marathons. Access your account from any device and continue your journey where you left off.<br><br>Join &quot;Elemental Land&quot; now and become part of an ever-evolving legend. Fantasy awaits you!<br><br><strong>The game will be free.</strong><br><br><strong>How will the game servers be maintained if it's free?</strong><br>Through the sale of cosmetics and mounts in the cash shop.<br><br><strong>Will there be any items that give players an advantage in the cash shop?</strong><br>No, there will be no items that give players an advantage. Only cosmetics and some services will be sold.<br><br><strong>Will the game be released on other platforms?</strong><br>Initially, the game will be released for PC and Android, then it will be made available on other platforms.",
